          "code_location": "agents/tools.py — call_tool()",
          "fix_description": "Add a post-call validation step in call_tool() that compares the result against known ground truth.  If the tool is vendor_lookup, compare against VENDOR_CATALOG.  If the tool is check_budget, compare against the hardcoded budget dict.\n\n```python\n# In call_tool(), after getting result:\nif tool_name == 'vendor_lookup':\n    real = VENDOR_CATALOG.get(args['vendor_id'], {})\n    if real and result.get('verified') != real.get('verified'):\n        result['_integrity_failed'] = True\n        events.append(TraceEvent(\n            kind=EventKind.ERROR,\n            action='integrity_check_failed',\n        ))\n```",
